indow and the extended 400-day retention period for deletion audit records.Ravi: Morgan, the secret-scrub step involves overwriting the deleted data with random data multiple times to ensure that the information cannot be recovered. This aligns with GDPR and other data protection regulations requiring permanent deletion of sensitive data. Owen can confirm that the storage infrastructure can support a 45-day recovery window and the extended 400-day retention period for deletion audit records.
